dule-isganamargi bendakmala,","poem":1},{"text":"dule-ibmar-abedimalad be dule-isganamargi bendakmala.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"”We-dule-isganamar ibmar wissurmalad, ibmar aku-itomalad,","poem":1},{"text":"negsichidgi gaamakdimalad,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"weyob gudimaladba bela napneg-saila-giglimakega imakmalad.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"”An bemarga sogsa gusad: ‘Bemar bab-dummagan gumarye,","poem":1},{"text":"bela-bemar Bab-Dummad-Bur-Birigined-e-mimmigan gumarye.’","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Degi-inigwele, bemar dulemaryobi burgwemaloye,","poem":1},{"text":"dummagan-negsemamaidyobi burgwemaloye.”","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"¡Bab-Dummad! We-napnegga be igar itodage,","poem":1},{"text":"ar bela-dule-napneggi-bukwamalad begadid.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/PSA/82.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/PSA/83.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/PSA/81.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}